fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstevent.html#gst_event_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_event_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Event.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Event.is_writable\n\nTests if you can safely modify event. It is only safe to modify event when\nthere is only one owner of the event - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na GstEvent\nTests if you can safely modify event. It is only safe to modify event when\nthere is only one owner of the event - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Event\nTests if you can safely modify event. It is only safe to modify event when\nthere is only one owner of the event - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Event\n"});